'' '#undef' of a KEYWORD -- the half of quirk/undef.bas that needs no symbol table.
'' The measurements this asserts are in the source's own header.
''
'' The load-bearing facts, all three of them what fbc does:
''   'local i64 x'        'type short as integer' after '#undef short' takes effect
''                        (this was 'local i16 x' before: WRONG, and silent)
''   'local i64 mod'      an OPERATOR-class keyword de-reserves too, and the word
''                        is then usable as an ordinary identifier
''   '0 statements not lowered'  and no diagnostic for '#undef NeverExisted'
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: --dump-ir tests/pp/src/undef-keyword.bas
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-OUT: local i64 x
'' EXPECT-OUT: local i64 mod
'' EXPECT-OUT: 0 statements not lowered
'' EXPECT-NOT: local i16
'' EXPECT-NOT: error TKO
